-- `shoots at TARGET [every N [seconds|frames]] [speed S]` — the marker (with its
-- cooldown) and the `shots` list are ordinary fc data, so exec-diff sees them.
-- Defaults: target `player`, every 60 frames (1 second), speed 2.
turret is {x: 100, y: 60}
turret shoots at player
gunner is {x: 40, y: 40}
gunner shoots at player every 2 seconds speed 3
sentry is {x: 10, y: 10}
sentry shoots
